    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NIGHTMARE</strong> <br>Take on the role of Mike, a lonely child who has suffered a tragic accident. Now in critical condition, your thoughts fixate on a single dream: a visit to the circus. As your life hangs by a thread, a demonic entity grants your final wish, but it wants your pure soul in return. <br> <br>The circus you longed for is fusing with your memories, twisting into your worst nightmare. You must survive and escape... before it consumes you. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/cf3df0794dfa1861aa0da1196017a595.poster.avif?t=1755748589\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/cf3df0794dfa1861aa0da1196017a595.webm?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/cf3df0794dfa1861aa0da1196017a595.mp4?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><strong>BEWARE OF THE CLOWN</strong><br>The demon has taken the form of a monstrous clown, stalking through your thoughts and drawn to the slightest sound. Move carefully, and use your small size for hiding to evade it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/9cced25e239a89960edf440b27875d44.poster.avif?t=1755748589\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/9cced25e239a89960edf440b27875d44.webm?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/9cced25e239a89960edf440b27875d44.mp4?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><strong>COLLECT THE POSTERS</strong><br>Hidden circus posters act as seals, keeping you trapped in this mental prison. Gathering them all is your only chance to clear your mind and survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/0ff794e502304c10a9e3a7d2c34e31c5.poster.avif?t=1755748589\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/0ff794e502304c10a9e3a7d2c34e31c5.webm?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/0ff794e502304c10a9e3a7d2c34e31c5.mp4?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-present monstrous clown that can hear you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense stealth gameplay focused on sneaking, hiding, and escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeform exploration. The\u00a0eerie circus is an open area to discover as you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings. Immerse yourself in a dramatic story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME LENGTH</strong><br>20-60 minutes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NIGHTMARE</strong> <br>Take on the role of Mike, a lonely child who has suffered a tragic accident. Now in critical condition, your thoughts fixate on a single dream: a visit to the circus. As your life hangs by a thread, a demonic entity grants your final wish, but it wants your pure soul in return. <br> <br>The circus you longed for is fusing with your memories, twisting into your worst nightmare. You must survive and escape... before it consumes you. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/cf3df0794dfa1861aa0da1196017a595.poster.avif?t=1755748589\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/cf3df0794dfa1861aa0da1196017a595.webm?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/cf3df0794dfa1861aa0da1196017a595.mp4?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><strong>BEWARE OF THE CLOWN</strong><br>The demon has taken the form of a monstrous clown, stalking through your thoughts and drawn to the slightest sound. Move carefully, and use your small size for hiding to evade it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/9cced25e239a89960edf440b27875d44.poster.avif?t=1755748589\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/9cced25e239a89960edf440b27875d44.webm?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/9cced25e239a89960edf440b27875d44.mp4?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><strong>COLLECT THE POSTERS</strong><br>Hidden circus posters act as seals, keeping you trapped in this mental prison. Gathering them all is your only chance to clear your mind and survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/0ff794e502304c10a9e3a7d2c34e31c5.poster.avif?t=1755748589\" width=600 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/0ff794e502304c10a9e3a7d2c34e31c5.webm?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709810/extras/0ff794e502304c10a9e3a7d2c34e31c5.mp4?t=1755748589\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-present monstrous clown that can hear you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense stealth gameplay focused on sneaking, hiding, and escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeform exploration. The\u00a0eerie circus is an open area to discover as you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings. Immerse yourself in a dramatic story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME LENGTH</strong><br>20-60 minutes.</p>",
